From: Cheick Traore <cheick.traore@foss.st.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Oct 2024 11:17:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: serial: stm32: update clocks property

Update "clocks" property to support 2 clocks in stm32 serial binding.

Change-Id: I917344433d258618a2689ff48a223943f14f5843
Signed-off-by: Cheick Traore <cheick.traore@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/410081
Tested-by: Cheick TRAORE <cheick.traore-ext@st.com>
Domain-Review: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Cheick TRAORE <cheick.traore-ext@st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/st,stm32-uart.yaml | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/st,stm32-uart.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/st,stm32-uart.yaml
index 2ed526139269..fd098fbb1b68 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/st,stm32-uart.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/st,stm32-uart.yaml
@@ -23,7 +23,8 @@ properties:
     maxItems: 1
 
   clocks:
-    maxItems: 1
+    minItems: 1
+    maxItems: 2
 
   resets:
     maxItems: 1
-- 
